 "brief_summary": "The current trial will examine the efficacy and safety of Exubera administered as a mealtime insulin compared to lispro, when added to an existing regimen of basal insulin glargine + or = Oral Agents (OAs). Dose titrations will be provided which should allow a large proportion of subjects to reach target glycosylated hemoglobin (A1C) levels.",
 "eligibility": {
  "criteria": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Adults with type 2 diabetes using Lantus® (insulin glargine) as their basal insulin, not at glycemic goal.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* lung disease\n* current smoking or discontinued smoking within past 6 months",
